      "canonical_latex": "D_0 = \\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\rho}}_1 \\cdot (\\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\rho}}_2 \\times \\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\rho}}_3),\\quad D_{ij} = (\\mathbf{R}_i \\times \\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\rho}}_2)\\cdot\\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\rho}}_3 \\text{ etc.}",
